    <MissileTemplate>
      <AssociatedTemplateName>SGM-200 Killjoy Whirligig</AssociatedTemplateName>
      <Designation>SGM-200</Designation>
      <Nickname>Killjoy Whirligig</Nickname>
      <Description>$MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;$MISSILESEEKER_MODE_COMMAND_ABBREV&lt;/color&gt; - $MISSILESTAT_NONE</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-200 Killjoy Whirligig&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 2 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGM-2 body, which is a flexible mainstay anti-ship missile.  This missile will deliver no payload.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT
